The XW encodings follow WCH's encoding table (posted to LLVM discourse thread 79392) and LLVM's
Xwchc implementation; the WCH custom encodings follow WCH's GCC 15 binutils and the CH32V407
Reference Manual V1.3. No code or data from any of them is included.

WCH, QingKe and CH32 are names of Nanjing Qinheng Microelectronics (WCH). This project is not made,
